WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
A screen recording, no editing: we pick a file and a language

00:04.000 --> 00:06.000
We press “Translate” (Перевести) — the only button

00:06.000 --> 00:12.500
The rest is on us: the project is created and the translation starts by itself 7 seconds later

00:12.500 --> 00:18.500
Translation and checks run on their own · shown ×8 · really 49 s

00:18.500 --> 00:23.000
Done: all 4 lines translated and checked — 56 s after the click

00:23.000 --> 00:30.000
“Download” (Скачать) — the same Word file, now in English

